  "repin_rationale": "RE-PINNED at live df165492 (media-intake promote). Two changes, both re-derived from the new contract: (1) a final em-dash sanitizer deep-walks the returned payload, so every U+2014 in user_response / variables.* folds to a plain hyphen; (2) miss/DYM lines now carry an entity-type suffix ` (<type>)` on the quoted token - resolver PRIMARY (that token's resolution matches[0].entity_type, prettified only when snake_case/kebab), parser `hint` FALLBACK, bare when neither classifies. The new MI-D media-confirm prefix is inert on these fixtures (patch-transcript not executed). Numbering, dym_last_result_set and dym candidates are unchanged."
